  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 2,500eb (Luxury)</p>\n<p><strong>Mods:</strong> Smartgun Link and Smart Rebuild Attachments</p>\n<p><em>Computational targeting software is rarely limited in proficiency.</em></p>\n<p>When firing a weapon equipped with an Advanced Smartlink modified Smart Rebuild or Smartgun Link, if the user rolls a Critical Failure (1) during the Attack Check, they do not roll an implosion d10. All other effects or results of the Critical Failure still occur.</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0 (Weapon Mod)</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Mod Catalog &gt; Attachment Mods).</em></p>"
